flowchart LR
    A[Verified 15-file legacy archive<br/>restore + scan + tag + retention] --> V[assemble-final-state]
    R[Trade report category<br/>normalized facts + raw report] --> V
    B[Broker account category<br/>reviewed inventory + raw export] --> V
    S[Service configuration category<br/>status + pause flag + five writer inventories] --> V
    P[Frozen policy<br/>5-minute skew + 1-hour age] --> V

    V --> C{Archive replay, raw hashes,<br/>identity, timing and reconciliation valid?}
    C -- no --> X[Fail closed<br/>no final state]
    C -- yes --> F[LegacyFinalState v2<br/>derived counts + provenance]
    F --> I[Independent verify-final-state replay]
    I --> Q[Cross-bundle readiness assembly<br/>native identity + dual-root replay]

    N[No broker, MT5, signer, network,<br/>pause, order, stop or delete capability] -. security boundary .- V
